---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Data Analysis & External Signal Mapping | Ceres Technology"
  description="Ceres maps geospatial, demographic, and market signals onto your internal records — replacing weeks of manual spreadsheet work with automated scorecards, exposure maps, and record classification."
>
  <main class="flex-grow flex flex-col items-center justify-start w-full bg-surface-container-lowest">

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-24 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-16">
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 flex flex-col items-start gap-8 z-10 relative">
        <div class="absolute -top-12 -left-8 w-24 h-24 border-t border-l border-primary/30 z-0"></div>
        <h1 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface leading-none z-10">
          Map external data onto your internal records to automate complex analysis.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7] max-w-prose border-l-4 border-primary pl-6 py-2">
          We help enterprise operations, risk, and planning teams connect their internal systems to real-world geospatial, demographic, and market signals. Ceres automatically merges your data to build scorecards, map exposures, and classify records without weeks of manual spreadsheet work.
        </p>
        <div class="flex gap-4 pt-4">
          <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="btn-primary">
            Book a Demo
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">arrow_forward</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 relative min-h-[500px]">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 machined-gradient border border-outline-variant/30 overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="w-full h-full opacity-20 relative">
            <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: linear-gradient(#45474B 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(90deg, #45474B 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 20px 20px;"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 bg-surface-container-high border border-outline-variant p-4 industrial-shadow z-10 w-48">
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Internal DB</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-headline font-bold text-on-surface">Asset Records</div>
            <div class="h-1 w-full bg-surface-container-low mt-2"><div class="h-full bg-primary w-3/4"></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-1/3 right-1/4 bg-surface-container-high border border-outline-variant p-4 industrial-shadow z-10 w-48">
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant mb-1">Ext. Signal: Weather</div>
            <div class="text-sm font-headline font-bold text-on-surface">Weather Data</div>
            <div class="flex gap-1 mt-2">
              <span class="h-2 w-2 bg-primary"></span>
              <span class="h-2 w-2 bg-primary"></span>
              <span class="h-2 w-2 bg-surface-container-low"></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-0" pointer-events="none">
            <path d="M 150 150 C 250 150, 250 350, 350 350" fill="none" opacity="0.6" stroke="#F37221" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke-width="2"></path>
          </svg>
          <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 bg-surface border border-primary p-6 industrial-shadow z-20 flex flex-col items-center">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-2">hub</span>
            <div class="section-label">Ceres Engine</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
    <section class="w-full bg-surface py-24 border-t border-outline-variant/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="mb-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-6 flex justify-between items-end">
          <div>
            <div class="section-label mb-2">The bottleneck</div>
            <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface">Manual reconciliation holds teams back</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant hidden md:block">ERR: MANUAL_RECONCILIATION</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-lg font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant mb-12 max-w-prose leading-[1.7]">
          Analyzing your records against outside data is a massive manual bottleneck. Your internal assets live in your database, but the external data (weather, demographics, etc.) lives everywhere else.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border-l-2 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface">engineering</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Trapped Analysts</h3>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Analysts spend all day compiling data instead of using it.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-outline-variant/20 font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-error">Status: Critical Drain</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border-l-2 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface">map</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Stale Data Artifacts</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Disconnected data creates bottlenecks, leaving less time for decision-making.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container p-6 border-l-2 border-outline-variant hover:border-primary hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors flex flex-col gap-4">
            <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-on-surface">find_in_page</span>
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Unstructured Grind</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Manual review of unstructured records does not scale.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- THE SOLUTION (BENTO GRID) -->
    <section class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest py-24 border-t border-outline-variant/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="mb-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-6">
          <div class="section-label mb-2">What Ceres does</div>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface">Connect signals in minutes</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 auto-rows-[200px]">
          <div class="md:col-span-2 md:row-span-2 bg-surface-container p-8 relative overflow-hidden group hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
            <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 p-4">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary transition-colors text-4xl">merge_type</span>
            </div>
            <div class="h-full flex flex-col justify-end z-10 relative">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Automate data blending</h3>
              <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Seamlessly merge disparate internal datasets with complex external feeds without writing custom ETL pipelines.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-1/2 bg-gradient-to-b from-surface-container-high to-transparent opacity-50"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-surface-container p-6 relative group hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors flex flex-col justify-between border-b-2 border-transparent hover:border-primary">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-start">
              <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Overlay external signals</h3>
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary transition-colors">layers</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Instantly map demographic, geospatial, and market data onto your existing records.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-1 bg-surface-container p-6 relative group hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors border-l-2 border-transparent hover:border-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-4 block">score</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">Dynamic Scorecards</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Generate real-time risk and opportunity scores.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="md:col-span-1 bg-surface-container p-6 relative group hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors border-l-2 border-transparent hover:border-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary transition-colors mb-4 block">science</span>
            <h3 class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em] mb-2">What-If Scenarios</h3>
            <p class="text-xs font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant leading-[1.7]">Run simulations based on shifting external variables.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- EXAMPLES -->
    <section class="w-full bg-surface py-24 border-t border-outline-variant/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="mb-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-6 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-4">
          <div>
            <div class="section-label mb-2">Use cases</div>
            <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface">Replacing spreadsheets</h2>
          </div>
          <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="bg-surface-container text-on-surface font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase px-4 py-2 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors border border-outline-variant/50 self-start md:self-auto inline-flex items-center">
            View all cases
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-2">
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors p-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between border-l-4 border-transparent hover:border-primary group">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2 md:mb-0">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary">inventory</span>
              <span class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Supply Risk Scorecards</span>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant hidden w-full md:w-1/3 text-left md:text-right">Vendor data</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors p-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between border-l-4 border-transparent hover:border-primary group">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2 md:mb-0">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary">public</span>
              <span class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Portfolio Exposure Mapping</span>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant hidden w-full md:w-1/3 text-left md:text-right">Geo exposure</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors p-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between border-l-4 border-transparent hover:border-primary group">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2 md:mb-0">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary">track_changes</span>
              <span class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Geospatial Audience Targeting</span>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant hidden w-full md:w-1/3 text-left md:text-right">Geospatial layer</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors p-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between border-l-4 border-transparent hover:border-primary group">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2 md:mb-0">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary">subject</span>
              <span class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Text Categorization</span>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant hidden w-full md:w-1/3 text-left md:text-right">NLP Classify</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container transition-colors p-4 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between border-l-4 border-transparent hover:border-primary group">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2 md:mb-0">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline-variant group-hover:text-primary">trending_up</span>
              <span class="font-headline font-bold text-on-surface tracking-[0.015em]">Demand Forecasting</span>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant hidden w-full md:w-1/3 text-left md:text-right">Predictive model</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MEASURABLE RESULTS -->
    <section class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest py-24 border-t border-outline-variant/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="mb-12 border-b border-outline-variant/20 pb-6 text-center">
          <div class="section-label mb-2">Telemetry</div>
          <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface">Measurable results</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-1">
          <div class="card flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
            <div class="font-mono font-light text-3xl md:text-4xl text-primary mb-2 data-mono">Wk→Min</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant text-center">Processing Time</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
            <div class="font-mono font-light text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface mb-2 data-mono">
              <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl">bolt</span>
            </div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant text-center">Instant Categorization</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
            <div class="font-mono font-light text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface mb-2 data-mono">TB+</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant text-center">Massive Scale</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-8 hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors">
            <div class="font-mono font-light text-3xl md:text-4xl text-on-surface mb-2 data-mono">API/DB</div>
            <div class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.18em] uppercase text-on-surface-variant text-center">Direct Integration</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FINAL CTA -->
    <section class="w-full bg-surface py-32 border-t-4 border-primary">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
        <h2 class="font-headline font-extrabold tracking-[-0.01em] text-on-surface mb-6 leading-none">
          Ready to see it work with your data?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xl font-body font-normal text-on-surface-variant mb-10 max-w-prose leading-[1.7]">
          Stop losing days to manual data reconciliation.
        </p>
        <a href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.endsWith("/") ? import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "book-a-demo/" : import.meta.env.BASE_URL + "/book-a-demo/"} class="btn-primary shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(243,114,33,0.3)] hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(243,114,33,0.5)]">
          Book a Demo
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</Layout>
